---
title: Butter Toffee
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Candy
cook time: 12 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@butter{0.5%lb}
@sugar{1%cup}
@chopped almonds{1%cup}
@Hershey bars{2}

Mix butter and sugar and boil for 7 minutes, stirring constantly. Add chopped almonds and cook for 5 minutes more. Stir constantly. Pour into 8 inch square pan. Lay 2 Hershey bars on top and spread when melted. Cut into pieces.
